// Mech Expo 2000 - a side-on mech fighting game for the Mei console. Rival companies bring their
// newest mechs to the year 2000's big expo, where the UAPC runs a trial for a defence contract;
// every fight is a product demonstration. README.md is the contract, STYLE.md the look.
//
// Stick or d-pad: walk, crouch, the direction of a move. A attack, B special, X jump, Y grab,
// R block, A + B super. START: start, pause. SELECT in a fight: the camera's framing.
//
// This file is the cart's entry point; the game is in game.akr, so that tests can import it with
// scripted input (their harness replaces its weak input hooks).
cart "Mech Expo 2000", "MECHEXPO"

import "game.akr"
